{"id":"n38025-1-7","stage":4,"title":"끌어내다 · 拉出去","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38025-1-7-1","ko":"저희가 뭐부터 도와 드리면 될까요?","zh":"我们需要先帮您做些什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희가","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"1","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희가","audio":"/audio/5fde57140294674af4ed.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐부터","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐부터","audio":"/audio/042ec9ac485e910cecaa.mp3"}},{"text":"도와","meaning":"帮，帮助","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와","audio":"/audio/b8a529b6c5e5ec83bac8.mp3"}},{"text":"드리면","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리면","audio":"/audio/b2338136b63b7c2c8f07.mp3"}},{"text":"될까요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될까요","audio":"/audio/f7e990fb15ccc0daff50.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2bb1d0e41028a9992fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38025-1-7-2","ko":"미리 싸 놓은 이삿짐을 집 밖으로 끌어내 주세요.","zh":"请把提前打包好的搬家物品拖到房子外面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미리","meaning":"事先，预先，事前，提前","explanation":"미리：事先，预先，事前，提前","readings":[{"term":"미리","audio":"/audio/b7c8ef4933c71a834692.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56292","senseId":"1","lemma":"미리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미리","audio":"/audio/b7c8ef4933c71a834692.mp3"}},{"text":"싸","meaning":"装，打包","explanation":"싸다：装，打包；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65049","senseId":"3","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸","audio":"/audio/3e0d74279c237c371475.mp3"}},{"text":"놓은","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓은","audio":"/audio/269721ea83189783919a.mp3"}},{"text":"이삿짐을","meaning":"搬家的东西","explanation":"이삿짐：搬家的东西；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이삿짐","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71996","senseId":"1","lemma":"이삿짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이삿짐을","audio":"/audio/f3cc8ff02f890904e723.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"밖으로","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖으로","audio":"/audio/811b71edf01aa148f58a.mp3"}},{"text":"끌어내","meaning":"拉出去，拖出去","explanation":"끌어내다：拉出去，拖出去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"끌어내다","audio":"/audio/be5bc0e6ab7b00a4d727.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38025","senseId":"1","lemma":"끌어내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끌어내","audio":"/audio/6ac1e5c9c1d13f0c9ea2.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b7c8ef4933c71a83","term":"미리","zh":"事先，预先，事前，提前","audio":"/audio/b7c8ef4933c71a834692.mp3","entryId":"56292","definition":"先于某件事情发生之前。","pronunciation":["미리"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"装，打包","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"65049","definition":"为了将某个东西运往别处而用箱子、绳子或布等包起来。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","de